# Markdown documentation.
#
# Ignored by default: notes, roadmaps and generated references are working
# material, not part of what ships.
#
# Both exceptions are anchored with a leading slash. Without it, "README.md"
# matches at ANY depth, which silently re-includes assets/*/README.md as well —
# that is what the previous version of this file did.
#
# LICENSE.md is excepted deliberately: the AGPL requires the licence text to
# travel with the source, so it must not fall under the blanket *.md rule.
*.md
!/README.md
!/LICENSE.md

# Local-only development files.
#
# Kept on disk, deliberately out of the repository. AddonNodeDump logs an addon's
# node tree to the plugin log and is wired to nothing — it exists to answer
# questions about what the game actually puts in _AreaText and the loading-screen
# title, and should not ship as dead code.
src/RegionsOfXIV/Services/AddonNodeDump.cs

